<title>HONDURAS: Honduras Oct-Dec coffee exports 507,324 46-kg bags.</title>
<headline>Honduras Oct-Dec coffee exports 507,324 46-kg bags.</headline>
<dateline>TEGUCIGALPA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honduras exported more than 507,324 46-kg bags of coffee in the first three months of the 1996-1997 coffee harvest, the Honduran Coffee Institute (IHCAFE) said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Exports from October to December in the comparable year-ago period were 504,151 bags.</p>
<p>Honduras expects to produce three million 46-kg bags for the entire harvest, of which 2.8 million bags are expected to be exported, the report said. Exports in the 1995-1996 harvest totalled 2.4 million 46-kg bags.</p>
<p>--Gustavo Palencia, Honduras bureau +504 392885</p>
</text>
